Object.assign(window.__CMPDATA__=window.__CMPDATA__||{},{"cassandra-scylladb__32": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（无 CBO：靠建模，计划简单可预测）。 Cassandra 无代价优化器，查询性能由数据建模（分区键设计）决定，计划可预测但无自动优化 官方文档。 ALLOW FILTERING 全表扫描是经典生产事故源 社区共识。 ScyllaDB 保持 CQL 兼容，同样无 CBO 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（无 CBO：靠建模，计划简单可预测）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cassandra 无代价优化器，查询性能由数据建模（分区键设计）决定，计划可预测但无自动优化 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>ALLOW FILTERING 全表扫描是经典生产事故源 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>ScyllaDB 保持 CQL 兼容，同样无 CBO <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (No CBO: modeling decides; simple predictable plans). Cassandra has no cost-based optimizer; performance comes from data modeling (partition keys) — predictable b…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (No CBO: modeling decides; simple predictable plans).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cassandra has no cost-based optimizer; performance comes from data modeling (partition keys) — predictable but not auto-optimized <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>ALLOW FILTERING full scans are a classic production incident source <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>ScyllaDB stays CQL-compatible, likewise no CBO <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__33": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（Cassandra 参数上百；ScyllaDB 自调优）。 cassandra.yaml 上百参数，调优高度依赖建模与 compaction 策略 官方文档。 ScyllaDB 按分片自动调优，运维负担明显更低 官方文档。 诊断靠 nodetool/JMX，自治能力弱 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（Cassandra 参数上百；ScyllaDB 自调优）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>cassandra.yaml 上百参数，调优高度依赖建模与 compaction 策略 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>ScyllaDB 按分片自动调优，运维负担明显更低 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>诊断靠 nodetool/JMX，自治能力弱 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Cassandra: 100+ params; ScyllaDB self-tuning). cassandra.yaml holds 100+ parameters; tuning hinges on modeling and compaction strategy <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. ScyllaDB …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Cassandra: 100+ params; ScyllaDB self-tuning).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>cassandra.yaml holds 100+ parameters; tuning hinges on modeling and compaction strategy <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>ScyllaDB self-tunes per shard, much lower ops burden <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Diagnostics via nodetool/JMX; weak autonomy <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__34": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（SSTable 读写压缩时校验，无页级自愈）。 SSTable 在压缩与读写路径带校验，发现损坏可丢弃坏文件并从副本重建。官方文档 无 InnoDB 式的常驻页 checksum 开关；副本间分歧靠 repair / read-repair 收敛。社区实测 静默损坏若恰好落在所有副本同一位置，可能长期潜伏。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（SSTable 读写压缩时校验，无页级自愈）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SSTable 在压缩与读写路径带校验，发现损坏可丢弃坏文件并从副本重建。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>无 InnoDB 式的常驻页 checksum 开关；副本间分歧靠 repair / read-repair 收敛。<span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n<li>静默损坏若恰好落在所有副本同一位置，可能长期潜伏。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (SSTable checks on read/compact). SSTables carry checks along read and compaction paths; corrupt files can be dropped and rebuilt from replicas. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> N…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (SSTable checks on read/compact).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SSTables carry checks along read and compaction paths; corrupt files can be dropped and rebuilt from replicas. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>No always-on page checksum switch like InnoDB; replica divergence converges via repair / read-repair. <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n<li>Silent corruption landing on the same spot in all replicas can lurk undetected for a long time. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__35": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（查证为无存储过程/触发器）。 CQL 无存储过程、触发器、过程语言（查证为无）官方文档。 逻辑只能放在应用层或 Spark/DSE Analytics 侧 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（查证为无存储过程/触发器）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CQL 无存储过程、触发器、过程语言（查证为无）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>逻辑只能放在应用层或 Spark/DSE Analytics 侧 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Verified: no procedures/triggers). No stored procedures, triggers, or procedural language in CQL (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Logic lives in the app …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Verified: no procedures/triggers).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No stored procedures, triggers, or procedural language in CQL (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Logic lives in the app layer or Spark/DSE Analytics side <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__36": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（无外键/CHECK；应用层保证）。 无外键、CHECK、唯一约束（轻量事务仅条件写入）官方文档。 完整性靠应用层与反范式数据建模保证 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（无外键/CHECK；应用层保证）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无外键、CHECK、唯一约束（轻量事务仅条件写入）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>完整性靠应用层与反范式数据建模保证 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (No FK/CHECK; app-enforced). No FK, CHECK, or unique constraints (LWT is conditional write only) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Integrity via app layer and denormalized m…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (No FK/CHECK; app-enforced).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No FK, CHECK, or unique constraints (LWT is conditional write only) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Integrity via app layer and denormalized modeling <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__37": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（CQL 无窗口函数/CTE）。 CQL 无窗口函数、CTE、JOIN（查证为无）官方文档。 分析靠 Spark 连接器或 DSE Analytics 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（CQL 无窗口函数/CTE）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CQL 无窗口函数、CTE、JOIN（查证为无）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>分析靠 Spark 连接器或 DSE Analytics <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (No windows/CTEs in CQL). No window functions, CTEs, or JOINs in CQL (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Analytics via Spark connector or DSE Analytics (comm…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (No windows/CTEs in CQL).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No window functions, CTEs, or JOINs in CQL (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Analytics via Spark connector or DSE Analytics <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__38": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（墓碑残留；gc_grace_seconds窗口）。 DELETE 写墓碑（tombstone），在 gc_grace_seconds（默认 10 天）内物理残留，压缩后才彻底消失 官方文档 墓碑堆积会引发读放大与“僵尸数据”复活风险，是运维与合规的双重坑 社区实测 快照、增量备份、repair 流转的数据都会延长残留期 官方文档…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（墓碑残留；gc_grace_seconds窗口）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DELETE 写墓碑（tombstone），在 gc_grace_seconds（默认 10 天）内物理残留，压缩后才彻底消失 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>墓碑堆积会引发读放大与“僵尸数据”复活风险，是运维与合规的双重坑 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n<li>快照、增量备份、repair 流转的数据都会延长残留期 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>无擦除证明，GDPR 场景需编排“删除 + 等待 GC + 清理快照” <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Tombstone residue; gc_grace_seconds window). DELETE writes tombstones that physically persist through gc_grace_seconds (default 10 days) until compaction removes…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Tombstone residue; gc_grace_seconds window).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DELETE writes tombstones that physically persist through gc_grace_seconds (default 10 days) until compaction removes them <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Tombstone buildup causes read amplification and zombie-data resurrection risk, a double pitfall for ops and compliance <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n<li>Snapshots, incremental backups, and repair-streamed data all extend the residue window <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>No erasure attestation; GDPR scenarios must orchestrate delete plus GC wait plus snapshot cleanup <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__39": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（查证为无原生血缘）。 无原生数据血缘/目录功能 官方文档。 需第三方数据治理平台对接 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（查证为无原生血缘）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无原生数据血缘/目录功能 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>需第三方数据治理平台对接 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Verified: no native lineage). No native data lineage/catalog features <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Requires third-party data governance platforms <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Verified: no native lineage).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No native data lineage/catalog features <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Requires third-party data governance platforms <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra：有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。nodetool snapshot（硬链接冻结 SSTable，秒级、无 IO 冲击但占同卷磁盘）+ 增量备份 + commitlog 归档可拼出 PITR；开源 Medusa（Spotify 起源，现由社区维护）支持全量/差异备份到 S3/GCS 并可校验；恢复为逐节点拷贝 SSTable …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Cassandra：<strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。<code>nodetool snapshot</code>（硬链接冻结 SSTable，秒级、无 IO 冲击但占同卷磁盘）+ 增量备份 + commitlog 归档可拼出 PITR；开源 <strong>Medusa</strong>（Spotify 起源，现由社区维护）支持全量/差异备份到 S3/GCS 并可校验；恢复为逐节点拷贝 SSTable 或 <code>sstableloader</code>，TB 级大集群恢复耗时以小时计<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB：<strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。<strong>ScyllaDB Manager</strong> 提供计划备份到 S3/GCS/Azure（<code>sctool</code>）；底层同样是 snapshot 机制；官方集成测试矩阵注明：恢复<strong>不支持 Authentication 与 Service Levels</strong> 的还原（官方仓库文档，选型时注意）。</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra: Supported (official docs / community consensus). nodetool snapshot (hard-link freeze of SSTables — instant, no IO impact, but consumes same-volume disk) + incr…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Cassandra: <strong>Supported</strong> (official docs / community consensus). <code>nodetool snapshot</code> (hard-link freeze of SSTables — instant, no IO impact, but consumes same-volume disk) + incremental backups + commitlog archiving can together approximate PITR; the open-source <strong>Medusa</strong> (originated at Spotify, now community-maintained) supports full/differential backups to S3/GCS with verification; recovery is per-node SSTable copies or <code>sstableloader</code>, with TB-scale large-cluster recovery taking hours <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB: <strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. <strong>ScyllaDB Manager</strong> provides scheduled backups to S3/GCS/Azure (<code>sctool</code>); the underlying mechanism is the same snapshot approach; the official integration-test matrix notes that recovery <strong>does not restore Authentication and Service Levels</strong> (official repo docs — note this when evaluating).</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__40": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（存算一体：本地盘 LSM）。 经典存算一体：每节点本地盘存 SSTable，扩缩容需数据重分布 官方文档。 本地盘带来高吞吐与低延迟，但弹性差 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（存算一体：本地盘 LSM）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>经典存算一体：每节点本地盘存 SSTable，扩缩容需数据重分布 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>本地盘带来高吞吐与低延迟，但弹性差 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Coupled: local-disk LSM). Classic coupled design: each node keeps SSTables on local disks; scaling reshuffles data <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Local disks give high throu…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Coupled: local-disk LSM).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Classic coupled design: each node keeps SSTables on local disks; scaling reshuffles data <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Local disks give high throughput/low latency but poor elasticity <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__41": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（宽列+集合类型，无向量/全文/图）。 模型限宽列、集合/UDT，无原生向量、全文、图能力 官方文档。 Stargate 等网关可转协议但不改变模型 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（宽列+集合类型，无向量/全文/图）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>模型限宽列、集合/UDT，无原生向量、全文、图能力 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Stargate 等网关可转协议但不改变模型 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Wide-column + collections only). Model limited to wide-column, collections/UDTs; no native vector, full-text, or graph <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Gateways like Starg…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Wide-column + collections only).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Model limited to wide-column, collections/UDTs; no native vector, full-text, or graph <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Gateways like Stargate translate protocols without changing the model <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__42": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（自建无计费，成本=硬件+运维人力自理）。 开源自建无内置计费概念，成本是节点硬件、存储与运维人力。社区共识 托管版（如 Astra DB）可在云账单侧做标签归因。厂商口径</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（自建无计费，成本=硬件+运维人力自理）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开源自建无内置计费概念，成本是节点硬件、存储与运维人力。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>托管版（如 Astra DB）可在云账单侧做标签归因。<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (No metering; hardware plus labor). Self-hosted open source has no built-in metering; costs are node hardware, storage, and operations labor. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span> Ma…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (No metering; hardware plus labor).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Self-hosted open source has no built-in metering; costs are node hardware, storage, and operations labor. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Managed editions (e.g. Astra DB) expose cost attribution on the cloud billing side. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__43": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（DataStax 驱动矩阵全；JDBC 靠 Simba）。 DataStax 官方 Java/Python/Node/Go/C# 驱动成熟 官方文档。 JDBC/ODBC 靠 Simba 等第三方驱动 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（DataStax 驱动矩阵全；JDBC 靠 Simba）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DataStax 官方 Java/Python/Node/Go/C# 驱动成熟 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>JDBC/ODBC 靠 Simba 等第三方驱动 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Full DataStax driver matrix; JDBC/ODBC via Simba). Mature official Java/Python/Node/Go/C# drivers from DataStax <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. JDBC/ODBC rely on third-party …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Full DataStax driver matrix; JDBC/ODBC via Simba).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mature official Java/Python/Node/Go/C# drivers from DataStax <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>JDBC/ODBC rely on third-party drivers like Simba <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__44": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（物化视图限制多，运维负担重）。 支持物化视图，但基表写入放大、修复运维负担重，限制多 官方文档。 社区普遍建议用应用层双写宽表替代 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（物化视图限制多，运维负担重）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>支持物化视图，但基表写入放大、修复运维负担重，限制多 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>社区普遍建议用应用层双写宽表替代 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (MVs with many limits). Materialized views exist but amplify writes and burden repairs, with many limits <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Community often prefers app-level dual-w…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (MVs with many limits).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Materialized views exist but amplify writes and burden repairs, with many limits <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Community often prefers app-level dual-written wide tables <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__45": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（开源任意云；ScyllaDB Cloud 多云）。 开源版任意云/自建可部署，无厂商绑定 官方文档。 ScyllaDB Cloud 支持 AWS/GCP，跨云靠自建集群 官方文档。 跨云延迟进 gossip/复制路径，网络质量关键 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（开源任意云；ScyllaDB Cloud 多云）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开源版任意云/自建可部署，无厂商绑定 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>ScyllaDB Cloud 支持 AWS/GCP，跨云靠自建集群 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>跨云延迟进 gossip/复制路径，网络质量关键 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Open source on any cloud; ScyllaDB Cloud multi-cloud). Open source deploys on any cloud/self-hosted; no vendor lock <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. ScyllaDB Cloud covers AWS/…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Open source on any cloud; ScyllaDB Cloud multi-cloud).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open source deploys on any cloud/self-hosted; no vendor lock <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>ScyllaDB Cloud covers AWS/GCP; cross-cloud via self-hosted clusters <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cross-cloud latency hits gossip/replication; network quality is key <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__46": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（无锁 LWW 写永不冲突，热点分区靠建模扛）。 并发控制原语是无锁追加写 + LWW：同一行并发写直接落 commitlog/memtable，以客户端时间戳定胜负，不存在锁等待、死锁、写冲突 abort，内核无需重试；写超时（coordinator 超时）由驱动按重试策略重发（驱动层），幂等写可安全重放。需要线性 CAS 时用 LW…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（无锁 LWW 写永不冲突，热点分区靠建模扛）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>并发控制原语是无锁追加写 + LWW：同一行并发写直接落 commitlog/memtable，以客户端时间戳定胜负，不存在锁等待、死锁、写冲突 abort，内核无需重试；写超时（coordinator 超时）由驱动按重试策略重发（驱动层），幂等写可安全重放。需要线性 CAS 时用 LWT（Paxos compare-and-set，Cassandra 4.1+ 可切 Paxos v2 降延迟），代价是多轮往返——热点 key 下 Paxos 串行化成瓶颈，热计数器禁用 LWT<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>衰减形态：热点打到同一分区键，该分区的副本集（RF=3 即三个节点）CPU/IO/压缩压力陡增；超大分区（官方口径 &gt;100MB 或 10 万 cell）还会引发 GC 停顿与读延迟毛刺；coordinator 对跨分区 batch/查询做汇聚，多分区 batch 反而加重协调者压力（官方：batch 为原子性而非性能，反模式）。读热点可被副本分摊，写热点不行——写必须走负责该 token 范围的副本集。ScyllaDB 2025.1+ 默认 tablets 按负载自动均衡 token 范围，但单个热分区键仍固定在一个 tablet/分片，加节点不分摊单 key 热度<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>内置缓解：未找到官方命名或文档化的热点行打散/自动迁移机制的证据（不是查证为无，靠应用层/建模）；可观测性侧有 <code>nodetool tablehistograms</code> 与表级指标定位热分区——检测手段，不是缓解。版本边界：ScyllaDB tablets（2025.1 默认）改善的是范围级负载均衡，不是 key 级打散<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n<li>应用层模式与代价：分区键加桶（如 (user_id, bucket)，Discord 按 10 天窗口分桶）把热分区拆成多个物理分区（代价：读需扇出 N 个分区合并，应用逻辑变复杂）；热计数器用分片计数器（N 行累加，代价：读时求和、短暂不一致）；读热点前置缓存（代价：只解决读，写热点无效，另有失效复杂度）；网关层对热 key 限流（代价：牺牲部分可用性）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported(Lock-free LWW writes never conflict; hot partitions are a modeling problem). The concurrency primitive is lock-free append writes plus last-write-wins: concurre…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong>(Lock-free LWW writes never conflict; hot partitions are a modeling problem).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The concurrency primitive is lock-free append writes plus last-write-wins: concurrent writes to one row land directly in the commitlog/memtable and resolve by client timestamp — no lock waiting, no deadlocks, no write-conflict aborts, no core-level retry. Write timeouts (coordinator timeouts) are resent per driver retry policy (driver layer); idempotent writes replay safely. Linearizable CAS uses LWT (Paxos compare-and-set; Cassandra 4.1+ can switch to Paxos v2 for lower latency), at the cost of multiple round trips — Paxos serializes into a bottleneck under a hot key, so hot counters must not use LWT <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Decay shape: a hotspot on one partition key steeply raises CPU/IO/compaction pressure on that partition&#x27;s replica set (three nodes at RF=3); oversized partitions (official guidance: &gt;100MB or 100K cells) additionally trigger GC pauses and read-latency spikes; the coordinator fans multi-partition batches/queries out and merges them back, so cross-partition batches worsen coordinator pressure (officially: batches exist for atomicity, not performance — an anti-pattern). Read hotspots spread across replicas; write hotspots do not — writes must go to the replica set owning that token range. ScyllaDB tablets (default since 2025.1) rebalance token ranges by load, but a single hot partition key still pins to one tablet/shard — adding nodes does not dilute single-key heat <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Built-in mitigation: no evidence found for an officially named or documented hot-row spreading or automatic-migration mechanism (not verified absent; it is an application/modeling concern). Observability offers <code>nodetool tablehistograms</code> and per-table metrics to locate hot partitions — detection, not mitigation. Version boundary: ScyllaDB tablets (default since 2025.1) improve range-level load balancing, not key-level spreading (to be verified).</li>\n<li>Application patterns and costs: bucket the partition key (e.g. (user_id, bucket); Discord buckets by 10-day windows) to split a hot partition into several physical ones (cost: reads fan out across N partitions and merge, complicating application logic); sharded counters for hot counters (N rows summed, cost: read-time summation, brief inconsistency); a cache in front of read hotspots (cost: useless against write hotspots, plus invalidation complexity); gateway-level rate limiting on hot keys (cost: sacrificed availability) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra：部分支持<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。nodetool + JMX 指标是官方链路；Prometheus/Grafana 需外部 exporter 或第三方采集器拼装，无官方内置端到端监控栈。 ScyllaDB：有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。内置 Prometheus metrics 端点 + 官方 ScyllaDB Monitoring…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Cassandra：<strong>部分支持</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。<code>nodetool</code> + JMX 指标是官方链路；Prometheus/Grafana 需外部 exporter 或第三方采集器拼装，无官方内置端到端监控栈。<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB：<strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。内置 <strong>Prometheus metrics 端点</strong> + 官方 <strong>ScyllaDB Monitoring</strong> Grafana 仪表盘栈（含告警），另有 REST API、tracing 与轻量慢查询日志。</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra: Partially supported (official docs / community consensus). nodetool + JMX metrics form the official path; Prometheus/Grafana require an external exporter or a …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Cassandra: <strong>Partially supported</strong> (official docs / community consensus). <code>nodetool</code> + JMX metrics form the official path; Prometheus/Grafana require an external exporter or a third-party collector assembled yourself — there is no official built-in end-to-end monitoring stack.<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB: <strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Built-in <strong>Prometheus metrics endpoint</strong> + the official <strong>ScyllaDB Monitoring</strong> Grafana dashboard stack (with alerting), plus a REST API, tracing, and a lightweight slow-query log.</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。CQL 原生二进制协议；官方多语言驱动均为 token-aware（直连负责副本的节点，避开 coordinator 跳转）；ScyllaDB 另提供 shard-aware 端口（19042） 与专用驱动，直连目标 CPU shard。连接本身轻量，无 PG 式连接数瓶颈；但 coordinator 仍是跨分区查询的汇聚…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。CQL 原生二进制协议；官方多语言驱动均为 <strong>token-aware</strong>（直连负责副本的节点，避开 coordinator 跳转）；ScyllaDB 另提供 <strong>shard-aware 端口（19042）</strong> 与专用驱动，直连目标 CPU shard。连接本身轻量，无 PG 式连接数瓶颈；但 coordinator 仍是跨分区查询的汇聚点，超大应用机群仍建议经代理或驱动侧限流<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. CQL native binary protocol; all official multi-language drivers are token-aware (connecting directly to the nodes owning the replicas, av…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. CQL native binary protocol; all official multi-language drivers are <strong>token-aware</strong> (connecting directly to the nodes owning the replicas, avoiding coordinator hops); ScyllaDB additionally offers a <strong>shard-aware port (19042)</strong> and dedicated drivers that connect directly to the target CPU shard. Connections themselves are lightweight — no PG-style connection-count bottleneck; but the coordinator remains the aggregation point for cross-partition queries, so very large application fleets should still go through a proxy or driver-side throttling <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无多行 ACID</span><p class=\"snippet\">无多行 ACID（官方文档，查证为无）。单行写入原子；LWT（IF NOT EXISTS / IF 条件）提供单分区 Paxos compare-and-set 线性一致；BATCH 保证同分区原子性（非隔离性），跨分区 batch 仅保证最终写入、无隔离。Cassandra 4.1+ 可切 Paxos v2（paxos_variant:…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无多行 ACID</strong>（官方文档，查证为无）。单行写入原子；<strong>LWT</strong>（<code>IF NOT EXISTS</code> / <code>IF 条件</code>）提供单分区 Paxos compare-and-set 线性一致；<code>BATCH</code> 保证同分区原子性（非隔离性），跨分区 batch 仅保证最终写入、无隔离。Cassandra 4.1+ 可切 <strong>Paxos v2</strong>（<code>paxos_variant: v2</code>），无竞争 LWT 从 4 RTT 降到写 2 RTT/读 1 RTT（CEP-14，社区技术文档）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">No multi-row ACID</span><p class=\"snippet\">No multi-row ACID (official docs, confirmed absent). Single-row writes are atomic; LWT (IF NOT EXISTS / IF &lt;condition&gt;) provides single-partition Paxos compare-and-set li…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>No multi-row ACID</strong> (official docs, confirmed absent). Single-row writes are atomic; <strong>LWT</strong> (<code>IF NOT EXISTS</code> / <code>IF &lt;condition&gt;</code>) provides single-partition Paxos compare-and-set linearizable consistency; <code>BATCH</code> guarantees atomicity within a partition (not isolation), while cross-partition batches guarantee only eventual writes with no isolation. Cassandra 4.1+ can switch to <strong>Paxos v2</strong> (<code>paxos_variant: v2</code>), reducing contention-free LWT from 4 RTTs to 2 RTTs for writes / 1 RTT for reads (CEP-14, community technical docs).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无主对等复制</span><p class=\"snippet\">可调一致性<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。无主对等复制；每查询指定一致性级别（ONE / QUORUM / LOCAL_QUORUM / ALL 等）；W+R&gt;N 保证读写集合交集；副本缺失时靠 hinted handoff（默认 3 小时窗口）+ read repair + 周期性 anti-entropy repair 收敛。ScyllaDB 语义相同…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>可调一致性</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。无主对等复制；每查询指定一致性级别（ONE / QUORUM / LOCAL_QUORUM / ALL 等）；<code>W+R&gt;N</code> 保证读写集合交集；副本缺失时靠 <strong>hinted handoff</strong>（默认 3 小时窗口）+ <strong>read repair</strong> + 周期性 <strong>anti-entropy repair</strong> 收敛。ScyllaDB 语义相同，数据分布层自 2025.1 默认 <strong>tablets</strong>（替代 vnodes，Raft 负载均衡）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Tunable consistenc</span><p class=\"snippet\">Tunable consistency <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Leaderless peer replication; per-query consistency levels (ONE / QUORUM / LOCAL_QUORUM / ALL, etc.); W+R&gt;N guarantees read/write set …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Tunable consistency</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Leaderless peer replication; per-query consistency levels (ONE / QUORUM / LOCAL_QUORUM / ALL, etc.); <code>W+R&gt;N</code> guarantees read/write set intersection; when replicas are missing, convergence relies on <strong>hinted handoff</strong> (default 3-hour window) + <strong>read repair</strong> + periodic <strong>anti-entropy repair</strong>. ScyllaDB semantics are the same; its data-distribution layer defaults to <strong>tablets</strong> since 2025.1 (replacing vnodes, with Raft-based load balancing).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">横向 scale-out，在线</span><p class=\"snippet\">横向 scale-out，在线<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。加节点自动分担 token/tablet 范围；Cassandra 4.0 起符合条件的 SSTable 走零拷贝 streaming（官方口径，扩容快 5 倍为厂商口径）；ScyllaDB tablets + 文件级 streaming 使加节点更快（30 倍为厂商口径，见深水区）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>横向 scale-out，在线</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。加节点自动分担 token/tablet 范围；Cassandra 4.0 起符合条件的 SSTable 走零拷贝 streaming（官方口径，扩容快 5 倍为厂商口径）；ScyllaDB tablets + 文件级 streaming 使加节点更快（30 倍为厂商口径，见深水区）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Horizontal scale-o</span><p class=\"snippet\">Horizontal scale-out, online <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Adding nodes automatically re-shares token/tablet ranges; since Cassandra 4.0, eligible SSTables use zero-copy streaming (ve…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Horizontal scale-out, online</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Adding nodes automatically re-shares token/tablet ranges; since Cassandra 4.0, eligible SSTables use zero-copy streaming (vendor claim: 5x faster scale-out); ScyllaDB&#x27;s tablets + file-level streaming make adding nodes even faster (30x is a vendor claim — see deep-dive).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持——提供 encrypted 虚拟磁盘（storage policy 层），可包装本地盘、S3 等底层磁盘，按 AES-CTR 加密写入的数据文件，可按表/存储策略选择加密范围；不是&quot;一键覆盖全部数据目录&quot;的传统全库 TDE。ClickHouse Operator 文档明确：加密覆盖 MergeTree data parts，但 …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>——提供 <code>encrypted</code> 虚拟磁盘（storage policy 层），可包装本地盘、S3 等底层磁盘，按 AES-CTR 加密写入的数据文件，可按表/存储策略选择加密范围；不是&quot;一键覆盖全部数据目录&quot;的传统全库 TDE。ClickHouse Operator 文档明确：加密覆盖 MergeTree data parts，但 server metadata 与日志不覆盖——这部分仍需 LUKS、CSI 或云盘加密兜底；密钥丢失则已加密 part 无法读取。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（operator storage 指南、storing-data）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported — an encrypted virtual disk (storage-policy layer) can wrap local disks, S3 and other underlying disks, encrypting written data files with AES-CTR, se…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> — an <code>encrypted</code> virtual disk (storage-policy layer) can wrap local disks, S3 and other underlying disks, encrypting written data files with AES-CTR, selectable per table/storage policy; not a traditional &quot;one switch encrypts the whole data directory&quot; full-database TDE. ClickHouse Operator docs are explicit: encryption covers MergeTree data parts, but server metadata and logs are not covered — those still need LUKS, CSI or cloud-disk encryption; losing the key makes encrypted parts unreadable. Evidence: official docs (operator storage guide, storing-data).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__1": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——支持 HTTPS（8443）、secure native TCP（9440）、interserver HTTPS；支持服务端证书校验与 mTLS 客户端证书。注意：TLS 需显式配置，启用安全端口不会自动关闭明文端口（8123/9000/9009），需另行关闭或防火墙隔离。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（operator FIPS 指南、客户端配置…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——支持 HTTPS（8443）、secure native TCP（9440）、interserver HTTPS；支持服务端证书校验与 mTLS 客户端证书。注意：TLS 需显式配置，启用安全端口不会自动关闭明文端口（8123/9000/9009），需另行关闭或防火墙隔离。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（operator FIPS 指南、客户端配置文档）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — HTTPS (8443), secure native TCP (9440), interserver HTTPS; server certificate verification and mTLS client certificates. Caveat: TLS must be configured explic…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — HTTPS (8443), secure native TCP (9440), interserver HTTPS; server certificate verification and mTLS client certificates. Caveat: TLS must be configured explicitly; enabling secure ports does not automatically close plaintext ports (8123/9000/9009) — close them separately or firewall them off. Evidence: official docs (operator FIPS guide, client configuration docs).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__10": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持——接口广：HTTP/native、JDBC/ODBC、MySQL/PostgreSQL wire 协议（仅协议兼容，方言仍是 ClickHouse SQL）、Kafka/S3/Parquet/Iceberg 等表函数与外部表。但不是行为兼容：ORM 事务语义、UPDATE/DELETE、约束、MySQL/PG 特有 DDL 发过…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>——接口广：HTTP/native、JDBC/ODBC、MySQL/PostgreSQL wire 协议（仅协议兼容，方言仍是 ClickHouse SQL）、Kafka/S3/Parquet/Iceberg 等表函数与外部表。但不是行为兼容：ORM 事务语义、<code>UPDATE/DELETE</code>、约束、MySQL/PG 特有 DDL 发过来基本跑不通；<code>ORDER BY</code> 在 MergeTree 中是排序键/稀疏索引定义，不是&quot;结果排序保证/唯一主键&quot;。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（postgresql/mysql 接口）+ 社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported — broad interfaces: HTTP/native, JDBC/ODBC, MySQL/PostgreSQL wire protocols (protocol-compatible only — the dialect is still ClickHouse SQL), Kafka/S3…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> — broad interfaces: HTTP/native, JDBC/ODBC, MySQL/PostgreSQL wire protocols (protocol-compatible only — the dialect is still ClickHouse SQL), Kafka/S3/Parquet/Iceberg table functions and external tables. Not behavior-compatible: ORM transaction semantics, <code>UPDATE/DELETE</code>, constraints and MySQL/PG-specific DDL mostly won&#x27;t run; <code>ORDER BY</code> in MergeTree defines the sorting key/sparse index, not a &quot;result-order guarantee/unique primary key&quot;. Evidence: official docs (postgresql/mysql interfaces) + community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__11": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——开源内核 Apache License 2.0，无 BSL/open-core 限制，自建无商业授权成本；ClickHouse Cloud 为全托管商业服务，使用量计费（官方口径：计算按分钟、存储按 15 分钟计量，另有数据传输等维度）。证据：官方口径（Cloud 计费博客）+ 第三方拆解（价格数字易变，本档案不引用绝对价格）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——开源内核 Apache License 2.0，无 BSL/open-core 限制，自建无商业授权成本；ClickHouse Cloud 为全托管商业服务，使用量计费（官方口径：计算按分钟、存储按 15 分钟计量，另有数据传输等维度）。证据：官方口径（Cloud 计费博客）+ 第三方拆解（价格数字易变，本档案不引用绝对价格）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — open-source core under Apache License 2.0, no BSL/open-core restrictions, zero license cost for self-hosting; ClickHouse Cloud is the fully managed commercial…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — open-source core under Apache License 2.0, no BSL/open-core restrictions, zero license cost for self-hosting; ClickHouse Cloud is the fully managed commercial service with usage-based billing (official: compute per minute, storage per 15 minutes, plus data transfer and other dimensions). Evidence: official statements (Cloud billing blog) + third-party teardown (prices change fast — no absolute figures quoted).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__12": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——官方文档有中文版（clickhouse.com/docs/zh）、中文社区（clickhouse.cn）、CSDN/博客园/腾讯云开发者社区及《ClickHouse 实战》等书籍、美团/字节等大厂实践分享，入门到运维资料丰富。但最新版本特性与深水区内容英文更新更快，部分中文博客参数已过期，查参数以英文官方文档为准。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——官方文档有中文版（clickhouse.com/docs/zh）、中文社区（clickhouse.cn）、CSDN/博客园/腾讯云开发者社区及《ClickHouse 实战》等书籍、美团/字节等大厂实践分享，入门到运维资料丰富。但最新版本特性与深水区内容英文更新更快，部分中文博客参数已过期，查参数以英文官方文档为准。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — official docs have a Chinese edition (clickhouse.com/docs/zh), a Chinese community (clickhouse.cn), abundant CSDN/cnblogs/Tencent Cloud developer-community po…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — official docs have a Chinese edition (clickhouse.com/docs/zh), a Chinese community (clickhouse.cn), abundant CSDN/cnblogs/Tencent Cloud developer-community posts, books like 《ClickHouse 实战》, and production write-ups from Meituan/ByteDance — rich from入门 to operations. But English updates faster for the newest versions and deep-dive topics, and some Chinese blog posts carry stale parameters — verify parameters against the English official docs. Evidence: community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__13": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（OLAP 扫描性能标杆；点查弱）。 单机列存扫描 GB/s 量级（视硬件与压缩率，社区实测）；分布式表吞吐随节点数提升（社区实测，未验证严格线性） 社区实测。 点查/高频小写入弱；MergeTree 后台合并是主要调优点 社区共识。 排序键/分区键设计决定查询性能，建表即定生死 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（OLAP 扫描性能标杆；点查弱）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>单机列存扫描 GB/s 量级（视硬件与压缩率，社区实测）；分布式表吞吐随节点数提升（社区实测，未验证严格线性） <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</li>\n<li>点查/高频小写入弱；MergeTree 后台合并是主要调优点 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>排序键/分区键设计决定查询性能，建表即定生死 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (the OLAP scan benchmark; weak point lookups). Single-node columnar scans at GB/s scale (hardware/compression dependent, community-tested); distributed-table th…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (the OLAP scan benchmark; weak point lookups).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Single-node columnar scans at GB/s scale (hardware/compression dependent, community-tested); distributed-table throughput grows with node count (community-tested, strict linearity not verified) <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>.</li>\n<li>Weak point lookups and high-frequency small writes; MergeTree background merges are the main tuning knob <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Sort-key/partition-key design determines query performance — the table definition decides everything <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__14": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（ClickHouse Cloud 有 SOC2；开源无）。 ClickHouse Cloud：SOC2<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>厂商口径。 开源版：无官方合规认证，合规责任在部署方 社区共识。 无信创名录公开信息 待验证。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（ClickHouse Cloud 有 SOC2；开源无）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ClickHouse Cloud：SOC2<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span><span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>开源版：无官方合规认证，合规责任在部署方 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>无信创名录公开信息 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (ClickHouse Cloud has SOC2; open source has none). ClickHouse Cloud: SOC2 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>. Open source: no official compliance certs; de…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (ClickHouse Cloud has SOC2; open source has none).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ClickHouse Cloud: SOC2 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Open source: no official compliance certs; deployer responsible <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>No public trusted-innovation catalog information <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__15": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（2016 年开源；OLAP 开源标杆）。 2016 年由 Yandex 开源；2021 年 ClickHouse Inc 独立融资 社区共识。 GitHub stars 数万级，社区极活跃；云（Cloud）是商业化主线 社区共识。 版本迭代快，企业用需跟紧 LTS 线 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（2016 年开源；OLAP 开源标杆）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2016 年由 Yandex 开源；2021 年 ClickHouse Inc 独立融资 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>GitHub stars 数万级，社区极活跃；云（Cloud）是商业化主线 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>版本迭代快，企业用需跟紧 LTS 线 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (open-sourced 2016; the open-source OLAP benchmark). Open-sourced by Yandex 2016; ClickHouse Inc. spun out and funded 2021 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Tens of thousa…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (open-sourced 2016; the open-source OLAP benchmark).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open-sourced by Yandex 2016; ClickHouse Inc. spun out and funded 2021 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Tens of thousands of GitHub stars and a hyperactive community; Cloud is the commercial mainline <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Fast release cadence — enterprises should track the LTS line <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__16": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Cloudflare、字节等公开案例）。 Cloudflare（公开博客）、字节跳动等大规模用户 社区共识。 可观测性（日志分析）是最大采用场景之一 社区共识。 国内互联网大厂自建 ClickHouse 集群普遍 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Cloudflare、字节等公开案例）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cloudflare（公开博客）、字节跳动等大规模用户 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>可观测性（日志分析）是最大采用场景之一 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>国内互联网大厂自建 ClickHouse 集群普遍 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (public cases: Cloudflare, ByteDance, etc.). Large-scale public users: Cloudflare (public blog), ByteDance, etc. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Observability (log analy…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (public cases: Cloudflare, ByteDance, etc.).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Large-scale public users: Cloudflare (public blog), ByteDance, etc. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Observability (log analytics) is one of the biggest adoption scenarios <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Self-built ClickHouse clusters are common at Chinese hyperscalers <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__17": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（clickhouse-backup；Flink/Kafka 生态）。 备份：clickhouse-backup（社区事实标准）/官方备份恢复 社区共识。 入数：Kafka 表引擎、Flink CDC、clickhouse-copier（分片间）社区共识。 监控：Prometheus 集成；可视化：Tabix/官方 Play UI 社区…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（clickhouse-backup；Flink/Kafka 生态）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>备份：clickhouse-backup（社区事实标准）/官方备份恢复 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>入数：Kafka 表引擎、Flink CDC、clickhouse-copier（分片间）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>监控：Prometheus 集成；可视化：Tabix/官方 Play UI <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (clickhouse-backup; Flink/Kafka ecosystem). Backup: clickhouse-backup (community standard) / official BACKUP/RESTORE <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Ingestion: Kafka tab…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (clickhouse-backup; Flink/Kafka ecosystem).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Backup: clickhouse-backup (community standard) / official BACKUP/RESTORE <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Ingestion: Kafka table engine, Flink CDC, clickhouse-copier (inter-shard) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Monitoring: Prometheus integration; UIs: Tabix / official Play UI <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__18": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（ClickHouse Cloud；各云也有托管）。 ClickHouse Cloud（官方，Serverless/按量）官方文档。 各云厂商/第三方托管版多 社区共识。 云版与开源版能力对齐好 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（ClickHouse Cloud；各云也有托管）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ClickHouse Cloud（官方，Serverless/按量）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>各云厂商/第三方托管版多 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>云版与开源版能力对齐好 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (ClickHouse Cloud; hosted on clouds too). ClickHouse Cloud (official, serverless/pay-per-use) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Many cloud/third-party managed editions (communit…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (ClickHouse Cloud; hosted on clouds too).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ClickHouse Cloud (official, serverless/pay-per-use) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Many cloud/third-party managed editions <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Cloud and open-source editions well aligned <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__19": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（批量 INSERT/Kafka 引擎/S3 表函数，摄入是强项）。 批量：clickhouse-client/HTTP 批量 INSERT；支持 CSV/Parquet/JSONEachRow 等格式 官方文档。 流式：Kafka 表引擎直连消费；S3/s3Cluster 表函数直接读对象存储 官方文档。 大批量写入注意 parts …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（批量 INSERT/Kafka 引擎/S3 表函数，摄入是强项）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>批量：clickhouse-client/HTTP 批量 INSERT；支持 CSV/Parquet/JSONEachRow 等格式 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>流式：Kafka 表引擎直连消费；S3/s3Cluster 表函数直接读对象存储 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>大批量写入注意 parts 合并压力，分批与异步插入调优是常规操作 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Batch INSERT/Kafka engine/S3 table function; ingestion is a strength). Batch: clickhouse-client/HTTP batch INSERT; formats include CSV/Parquet/JSONEachRow (off…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Batch INSERT/Kafka engine/S3 table function; ingestion is a strength).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Batch: clickhouse-client/HTTP batch INSERT; formats include CSV/Parquet/JSONEachRow <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Streaming: Kafka table engine consumes directly; S3/s3Cluster table functions read object storage <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Heavy writes stress part merges — batching and async-insert tuning are routine <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持——system.query_log 记录查询文本、用户、起止时间、异常与资源用量，可作为数据库活动审计的基础；ClickHouse Cloud 默认开启 query logging。但自建版可被有权限的用户用 log_queries=0 关掉（除非把该设置的 writability 锁为 CONST），日志是本地表、无防篡改与集…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>——<code>system.query_log</code> 记录查询文本、用户、起止时间、异常与资源用量，可作为数据库活动审计的基础；ClickHouse Cloud 默认开启 query logging。但自建版可被有权限的用户用 <code>log_queries=0</code> 关掉（除非把该设置的 writability 锁为 CONST），日志是本地表、无防篡改与集中归集，需要自己配留存 TTL、导出与不可篡改流程；ClickHouse Cloud 控制面审计边界本轮未找到足够官方证据，不下&quot;完整支持&quot;结论。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（query_log 系统表）+ 社区安全实践。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported — system.query_log records query text, user, start/finish times, exceptions and resource usage, a workable basis for database-activity auditing; query…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> — <code>system.query_log</code> records query text, user, start/finish times, exceptions and resource usage, a workable basis for database-activity auditing; query logging is on by default in ClickHouse Cloud. But on self-managed deployments any privileged user can switch it off with <code>log_queries=0</code> (unless the setting&#x27;s writability is locked to CONST); logs are local tables with no tamper-proofing or centralized collection — retention TTLs, export and immutability pipelines are on you. The ClickHouse Cloud control-plane audit boundary lacked sufficient official evidence this round, so no &quot;fully supported&quot; claim. Evidence: official docs (query_log system table) + community security practices.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__20": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（S3/URL/MySQL/PG 表引擎；JDBC/ODBC 桥；DataLakeCatalog 可直写 OneLake Iceberg）。 S3、URL、File 表函数可直接查询外部数据不落地 官方文档。 MySQL/PostgreSQL 表引擎可联邦查询外部库表 官方文档。 jdbcBridge/odbcBridge 扩展到任意 …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（S3/URL/MySQL/PG 表引擎；JDBC/ODBC 桥；DataLakeCatalog 可直写 OneLake Iceberg）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>S3、URL、File 表函数可直接查询外部数据不落地 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>MySQL/PostgreSQL 表引擎可联邦查询外部库表 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>jdbcBridge/odbcBridge 扩展到任意 JDBC/ODBC 源 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>DataLakeCatalog（catalog_type=&#x27;onelake&#x27;）支持 INSERT INTO 把查询结果直写为 OneLake 的托管 Iceberg 表，写后自动被 OneLake 目录注册并继承其安全与治理模型 <code>官方博客</code>。</li>\n<li>同步的限制：OneLake 是首个支持 ClickHouse 写入的 catalog 类型，官方博客称其他 catalog 写入&quot;未来数月逐步支持&quot;，当前状态为查证为无 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>；写入走 ADLS Gen2 DFS 端点（onelake.dfs.fabric.microsoft.com），读取走 Blob 端点（onelake.blob.fabric.microsoft.com），remote_url_allow_hosts 只放行 .blob 会导致 INSERT 被拒，两端需同时放行 <code>官方 GitHub PR 说明</code>；连接依赖 Entra ID 服务主体（client_id/client_secret）并需 SET allow_database_iceberg=1 <code>官方博客</code>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (S3/URL/MySQL/PG table engines; JDBC/ODBC bridge; DataLakeCatalog writes Iceberg to OneLake). S3, URL and File table functions query external data without stagi…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (S3/URL/MySQL/PG table engines; JDBC/ODBC bridge; DataLakeCatalog writes Iceberg to OneLake).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>S3, URL and File table functions query external data without staging <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>MySQL/PostgreSQL table engines federate queries into external tables <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>jdbcBridge/odbcBridge extend to any JDBC/ODBC source <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>DataLakeCatalog (catalog_type=&#x27;onelake&#x27;) supports INSERT INTO to write query results directly as managed Iceberg tables in OneLake; written tables are registered in the OneLake catalog and inherit its security and governance model <code>(official blog)</code>.</li>\n<li>Paired limits: OneLake is the first catalog type with ClickHouse write support — the official blog says other catalogs will follow &quot;over the coming months&quot;, so writes to other catalog types are verified absent <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>; writes use the ADLS Gen2 DFS endpoint (onelake.dfs.fabric.microsoft.com) while reads use the Blob endpoint (onelake.blob.fabric.microsoft.com), so allowlisting only .blob in remote_url_allow_hosts causes INSERT to be rejected — both hosts must be allowlisted <code>(official GitHub PR note)</code>; the connection requires an Entra ID service principal (client_id/client_secret) and SET allow_database_iceberg=1 <code>(official blog)</code>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__21": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（无原生 CDC 输出；靠物化视图+Kafka 引擎外发）。 ClickHouse 不记录行级变更日志，无官方 CDC 输出 社区共识。 常见做法：物化视图 + Kafka 表引擎把结果推下游 社区实测。 上游变更一般靠 Debezium→Kafka→Kafka 引擎链路解决 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（无原生 CDC 输出；靠物化视图+Kafka 引擎外发）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ClickHouse 不记录行级变更日志，无官方 CDC 输出 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>常见做法：物化视图 + Kafka 表引擎把结果推下游 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</li>\n<li>上游变更一般靠 Debezium→Kafka→Kafka 引擎链路解决 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (No native CDC output; materialized views + Kafka engine). ClickHouse keeps no row-level change log; no official CDC output <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Com…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (No native CDC output; materialized views + Kafka engine).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ClickHouse keeps no row-level change log; no official CDC output <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Common pattern: materialized views + Kafka table engine push results downstream <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>.</li>\n<li>Upstream changes usually arrive via Debezium → Kafka → Kafka engine <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__22": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（TTL 表达式（列级/表级），后台自动清理）。 建表时 TTL datetime_col + INTERVAL，后台线程自动删过期分区/行 官方文档。 可配到列级（只删某列）或整行，TO DISK/VOLUME 支持冷热分层 官方文档。 清理依赖 merge，不能保证精确时刻删除，延迟分钟到小时级 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（TTL 表达式（列级/表级），后台自动清理）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>建表时 TTL datetime_col + INTERVAL，后台线程自动删过期分区/行 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>可配到列级（只删某列）或整行，TO DISK/VOLUME 支持冷热分层 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>清理依赖 merge，不能保证精确时刻删除，延迟分钟到小时级 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (TTL expressions (column-/table-level), cleaned in background). TTL datetime_col + INTERVAL at CREATE TABLE; a background thread removes expired parts/rows (off…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (TTL expressions (column-/table-level), cleaned in background).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>TTL datetime_col + INTERVAL at CREATE TABLE; a background thread removes expired parts/rows <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Column-level (drop one column) or row-level TTL, plus TO DISK/VOLUME for hot-cold tiering <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cleanup rides on merges, so expiry is not exact — minutes to hours of lag <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__23": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（ALTER 元数据轻量；mutation 重写代价高；ORDER BY 改不了）。 只改定义不碰数据：ADD COLUMN / RENAME / COMMENT COLUMN 是元数据级操作、瞬间完成，旧 part 的新列读时按默认值合成 官方文档。 重写数据但位置不变：ALTER UPDATE/DELETE 是 mutatio…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（ALTER 元数据轻量；mutation 重写代价高；ORDER BY 改不了）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>只改定义不碰数据：ADD COLUMN / RENAME / COMMENT COLUMN 是元数据级操作、瞬间完成，旧 part 的新列读时按默认值合成 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>重写数据但位置不变：ALTER UPDATE/DELETE 是 mutation——默认异步后台重写 parts，大表极慢且与 merge 共用线程池 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>；MODIFY COLUMN 改类型/CODEC、MATERIALIZE PROJECTION/INDEX 同理是重写 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>；另有轻量更新（patch parts）走增量路径 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>搬数据：ORDER BY（排序键）不可变——改排序键只能建新表 + INSERT SELECT + RENAME 全量迁移 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>；主键列/采样键列的删除与改类型受限，ALTER 不够就得重建表 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>验证约束：CHECK 约束支持（建表声明或 ADD/DROP CONSTRAINT），只校验 INSERT、不校验存量数据 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>；无外键、无唯一约束——PRIMARY KEY 只是稀疏索引配置 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。<ul>\n<li><strong>规模</strong>：第二类代价 O(n)，part 数/数据量越大越痛；大表 mutation 会堆积合并、拖慢复制，这就是&quot;测试环境在线、生产锁死&quot;的根源 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>语义</strong>：ALTER 会阻塞该表读写——长 SELECT 运行时 ALTER 等它完成，ALTER 运行时新查询排队 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>；mutation 默认异步、不可回滚（可 KILL）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>；集群表 ALTER ON CLUSTER 各副本异步应用，alter_sync 控制语句返回时机 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (Lightweight ALTER metadata ops; costly mutation rewrites; ORDER BY immutable). Definition-only, data untouched: ADD COLUMN / RENAME / COMMENT COLUMN …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (Lightweight ALTER metadata ops; costly mutation rewrites; ORDER BY immutable).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Definition-only, data untouched: ADD COLUMN / RENAME / COMMENT COLUMN are metadata-level ops that complete instantly; the new column on old parts is synthesized from the default expression at read time <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Rewrite data in place: ALTER UPDATE/DELETE are mutations — asynchronous background part rewrites by default, very slow on huge tables and sharing the merge thread pool <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>; MODIFY COLUMN (type/codec changes) and MATERIALIZE PROJECTION/INDEX rewrite the same way <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>; lightweight updates via patch parts take an incremental path instead <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Move data: ORDER BY (the sort key) is immutable — changing it means a full migration: new table + INSERT SELECT + RENAME <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>; dropping or retyping primary/sampling key columns is restricted, and when ALTER is not enough the documented path is rebuild-and-swap <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Validate constraints: CHECK constraints are supported (declared at CREATE TABLE or via ADD/DROP CONSTRAINT) but only validated on INSERT, never on existing data <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>; no foreign keys, no unique constraints — PRIMARY KEY is only a sparse-index configuration <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>"});